  "evidenceCaveats": [
    "Editor-Menu was captured while ready=false/busy=true; stable menu baselines use SettingsClosed or ReturnedMenu.",
    "Editor-Run contains a fallback string after Vector2 serialization; it is preserved raw and not treated as a structured page list. Resumed and Retry provide structured run evidence.",
    "The initial Bundle Run/Escape and Pause snapshots have different RunIds; their elapsed values are not a continuous pause-freeze measurement.",
    "Esc input was not reliably validated. The Escape-named snapshot shows an upgrade page and does not prove Escape handling.",
    "This evidence covers Windows Editor, not IL2CPP, Android, iOS, WebGL, or production HTTPS. It does not establish physical keyboard/gamepad or listening acceptance.",
    "BaselineConsole retains two unsupported editor status command errors and pre-existing deprecation/meta warnings. It is a baseline artifact, not the clean-session result."
